{"id":"n28104-1-6","stage":4,"title":"딱 · 戛然","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28104-1-6-1","ko":"왜 음악 소리가 딱 멈춘 거지?","zh":"为什么音乐声突然停了啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"음악","meaning":"音乐","explanation":"음악：音乐","readings":[{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71115","senseId":"1","lemma":"음악","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음악","audio":"/audio/88caa317d96897c98d10.mp3"}},{"text":"소리가","meaning":"声音，声，音，动静","explanation":"소리：声音，声，音，动静；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"1","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"소리가","audio":"/audio/0c12216fc63402c5db52.mp3"}},{"text":"딱","meaning":"戛然","explanation":"딱：戛然","readings":[{"term":"딱","audio":"/audio/c2f17f436a9934a6c4b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28104","senseId":"1","lemma":"딱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"딱","audio":"/audio/c2f17f436a9934a6c4b5.mp3"}},{"text":"멈춘","meaning":"停，止","explanation":"멈추다：停，止；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"멈추다","audio":"/audio/eaee887b30c38d735354.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46133","senseId":"2","lemma":"멈추다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"멈춘","audio":"/audio/b85c9eb97f3632ded236.mp3"}},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"那个","explanation":"거：那个；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66342","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"