72413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"되었나","meaning":"用完，没有","explanation":"되다：用完，没有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"15","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되었나","audio":"/audio/18a7bfc772e75931daf2.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6314a358f4e72c51","term":"라디오","zh":"收音机","audio":"/audio/6314a358f4e72c51b9cc.mp3","entryId":"66029","definition":"可以接收广播局发送的电波并把电波转换为音声的机械装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5e29d5dcb84b4546","term":"배터리","zh":"电池","audio":"/audio/5e29d5dcb84b45469293.mp3","entryId":"58288","definition":"为汽车、手机、钟表等供给所需电力的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"一点不剩或不落下而全部。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"用完，没有","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"某种事物不再发挥功能或寿命已尽。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/907707c015536e751848.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.355,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28104","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId"